// Managed by Allrun. Physical sand-in-water values for the whole run
// (sedFoam 3DScour tutorial / Nagel et al. 2020; mus = tan(32 deg)):
// the flow is developed in the rigid-bed precursor case, so there is no
// mus-based bed-freezing stage any more.
// mu2 MUST stay > mus: mu(I) runs from mus (I->0) to mu2 (I->inf), so
// mu2 < mus means friction weakens with shear rate -> ill-posed/unstable.
mus             mus  [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] 0.63;
mu2             mu2  [ 0 0 0 0 0 0 0 ] 1.13;
